  "id": "photosensitivity",
  "term": "photosensitivity",
  "definition": "Photosensitivity is sensitivity to light, reflected in how an organism’s behavior changes under different wavelengths of visible light. In the packet, it refers to behavioral responsiveness to light, which depends largely on the retina’s light-absorbing proteins.",
